{
  "slug": "subgraphs-skills",
  "name": "Subgraphs Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Expert knowledge for developing, testing, and optimizing subgraphs with The Graph protocol",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `subgraph-dev` (Expert knowledge for developing subgraphs with The Graph protocol), `subgraph-optimization` (Best practices for optimizing subgraph performance, indexing speed, and query responsiveness), `subgraph-testing` (Quality assurance for subgraphs using Matchstick unit testing, Subgraph Linter static analysis, and CI/CD integration)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install subgraphs-skills@claude-community` from `PaulieB14/subgraphs-skills`.",
